# label | keys | help key | on or off

Command line (types)
  run | enter | ↵ | on
  cancel | esc ctrl+c | esc | on
  cancel when empty | backspace ctrl+h | backspace/^h | on
  complete | tab | tab | on
  previous | shift+tab | shift+tab | on
